                  %em Intuitionistic sets and ordinals
                %a{:href => "http://www.paultaylor.eu/ordinals/#intso"} here
            %li
              %p
                See also Section 6.7 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Taylor"} Paul Taylor
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Practical Foundations of Mathematics
